# Line endings: the repository stores LF; a checkout gets the platform's
# own. Windows batch files are CRLF everywhere, because cmd.exe misreads
# labels and multi-line blocks in an LF .bat. The gradle wrapper script is
# run by sh and must stay LF.
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.jar binary
*.ico binary
*.obj binary
*.png binary
